  unitName: Mech Beauty Gwenevere (EU)
  unitId: 730226
  unitNumber: 7189
  description: "At 8 years old, Viviane\u2019s younger sister was already able to
    reproduce weapons and mechanics that only individuals considered geniuses could
    create. In addition to her knowledge of mechanics, she possessed beauty beyond
    compare. For this reason, she gained the title of Mech Beauty. Being of weak
    constitution, Gwenevere often relied on the medical abilities of her sister in
    order to stay in good health. For many years, she worked with her sister on different
    projects. Notably, they worked together on an armor that would allow one to travel
    through time. As time passed, her knowledge increased and she was chosen, to
    no surprise, as Queen of the Ancients. Her people were prosperous and happy throughout
    her reign. That was, until one fateful day. A powerful demon attacked the Kingdom
    of the Ancients. Being of a peaceful nature, they weren\u2019t ready to respond.
    The demon ravaged the kingdom, slaying most of the Ancients and leaving the two
    sisters, Viviane and Gwenevere, for dead. Having lost her arm during the demon
    attack, Gwenevere made a prosthetic mechanical arm in order to replace the lost
    limb: a powerful cannon to take revenge on this being who had stolen everything
    away from her. During the years that followed, she undertook a long voyage to
    find out information on the demon. While wandering about, she saved a young soldier
    who was at death\u2019s door. She developed a fondness for him, having survived
    a horrible battle during which he lost his arm, and she made a prosthetic mechanical
    arm for her new prot\xE9g\xE9."
  summonDesc: My knowledge will aid you in your quest, Summoner.
  fusionDesc: I will use this power to create even stronger machines.
